Minecraftia Regular by Andrew Tyler.
Source supplied by the project owner: minecraftia-font/Minecraftia-Regular.ttf

Original accompanying readme:
The font file in this archive was created by Andrew Tyler www.AndrewTyler.net and font@andrewtyler.net
Use at 12 or 24 px size with anti-alising off for best results.

GenerateUiAtlas rasterizes printable U+0020..U+007E at 12 px without
antialiasing into font.png and adds a white texel at (0,0) for rectangles.
The original TTF is not loaded by the game.
